{"id":"e6a1ed8511f909f2","group":"58","path":"58/batch03/58-df-jacobson-radical.md","title":"Jacobson Radical","display":"df-jacobson-radical — Jacobson Radical","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-jacobson-radical","aliases":["58-df-jacobson-radical"],"display":"df-jacobson-radical — Jacobson Radical","depends_on":["[[58-df-ring]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-jacobson-radical"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-jacobson-radical</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-jacobson-radical — Jacobson Radical"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1c30d21ea7b443f6\" href=\"?note=1c30d21ea7b443f6\" title=\"58-df-ring\">58-df-ring</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R,+,\\cdot,0_R,1_R,x,r,I,\\mathfrak m\\in V\\land\\operatorname{Ring}_S(R,+,\\cdot,0_R,1_R)\">\\(R,+,\\cdot,0_R,1_R,x,r,I,\\mathfrak m\\in V\\land\\operatorname{Ring}_S(R,+,\\cdot,0_R,1_R)\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1c30d21ea7b443f6\" href=\"?note=1c30d21ea7b443f6\" title=\"58-df-ring\">58-df-ring</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{LeftIdeal}_S,\\operatorname{MaximalLeftIdeal}_S\\subseteq V^6\">\\(\\operatorname{LeftIdeal}_S,\\operatorname{MaximalLeftIdeal}_S\\subseteq V^6\\)</span> (predicates with ring structure explicit)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LeftInvertible}_S\\subseteq V^6\">\\(\\mathrm{LeftInvertible}_S\\subseteq V^6\\)</span> (predicate with ring structure explicit)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Jac}:V^5\\to V\">\\(\\mathrm{Jac}:V^5\\to V\\)</span> (Jacobson-radical operator with ring structure explicit)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}jacobson\\text{-}radical\\text{-}left\\text{-}ideal} \\vdash \\operatorname{LeftIdeal}_S(I;R,+,\\cdot,0_R,1_R)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Ring}_S(R,+,\\cdot,0_R,1_R)\\land I\\subseteq R\\land0_R\\in I\\land\\forall a,b\\in I\\;(a-b\\in I)\\land\\forall r\\in R\\;\\forall a\\in I\\;(r\\cdot a\\in I)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}jacobson\\text{-}radical\\text{-}left\\text{-}ideal} \\vdash \\operatorname{LeftIdeal}_S(I;R,+,\\cdot,0_R,1_R)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Ring}_S(R,+,\\cdot,0_R,1_R)\\land I\\subseteq R\\land0_R\\in I\\land\\forall a,b\\in I\\;(a-b\\in I)\\land\\forall r\\in R\\;\\forall a\\in I\\;(r\\cdot a\\in I)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}jacobson\\text{-}radical\\text{-}maximal} \\vdash \\operatorname{MaximalLeftIdeal}_S(\\mathfrak m;R,+,\\cdot,0_R,1_R)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{LeftIdeal}_S(\\mathfrak m;R,+,\\cdot,0_R,1_R)\\land\\mathfrak m\\neq R\\land\\forall I\\;((\\operatorname{LeftIdeal}_S(I;R,+,\\cdot,0_R,1_R)\\land\\mathfrak m\\subseteq I\\subsetneq R)\\to I=\\mathfrak m)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}jacobson\\text{-}radical\\text{-}maximal} \\vdash \\operatorname{MaximalLeftIdeal}_S(\\mathfrak m;R,+,\\cdot,0_R,1_R)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{LeftIdeal}_S(\\mathfrak m;R,+,\\cdot,0_R,1_R)\\land\\mathfrak m\\neq R\\land\\forall I\\;((\\operatorname{LeftIdeal}_S(I;R,+,\\cdot,0_R,1_R)\\land\\mathfrak m\\subseteq I\\subsetneq R)\\to I=\\mathfrak m)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}jacobson\\text{-}radical\\text{-}intersection} \\vdash \\mathrm{Jac}(R,+,\\cdot,0_R,1_R)\\coloneqq\\{x\\in R:\\forall\\mathfrak m\\subseteq R\\;(\\operatorname{MaximalLeftIdeal}_S(\\mathfrak m;R,+,\\cdot,0_R,1_R)\\to x\\in\\mathfrak m)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}jacobson\\text{-}radical\\text{-}intersection} \\vdash \\mathrm{Jac}(R,+,\\cdot,0_R,1_R)\\coloneqq\\{x\\in R:\\forall\\mathfrak m\\subseteq R\\;(\\operatorname{MaximalLeftIdeal}_S(\\mathfrak m;R,+,\\cdot,0_R,1_R)\\to x\\in\\mathfrak m)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}jacobson\\text{-}radical\\text{-}left\\text{-}inverse} \\vdash \\mathrm{LeftInvertible}_S(a;R,+,\\cdot,0_R,1_R)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Ring}_S(R,+,\\cdot,0_R,1_R)\\land a\\in R\\land\\exists u\\in R\\;(u\\cdot a=1_R)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}jacobson\\text{-}radical\\text{-}left\\text{-}inverse} \\vdash \\mathrm{LeftInvertible}_S(a;R,+,\\cdot,0_R,1_R)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Ring}_S(R,+,\\cdot,0_R,1_R)\\land a\\in R\\land\\exists u\\in R\\;(u\\cdot a=1_R)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}jacobson\\text{-}radical\\text{-}criterion} \\vdash x\\in\\mathrm{Jac}(R,+,\\cdot,0_R,1_R)\\leftrightarrow x\\in R\\land\\forall r\\in R\\;\\mathrm{LeftInvertible}_S(1_R-r\\cdot x;R,+,\\cdot,0_R,1_R)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}jacobson\\text{-}radical\\text{-}criterion} \\vdash x\\in\\mathrm{Jac}(R,+,\\cdot,0_R,1_R)\\leftrightarrow x\\in R\\land\\forall r\\in R\\;\\mathrm{LeftInvertible}_S(1_R-r\\cdot x;R,+,\\cdot,0_R,1_R)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The Jacobson radical is the intersection of all maximal left ideals.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathrm{Jac}(R)\">\\(x\\in\\mathrm{Jac}(R)\\)</span> iff <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1_R-rx\">\\(1_R-rx\\)</span> is left invertible for every <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\\in R\">\\(r\\in R\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Nilpotent ideals are contained in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Jac}(R)\">\\(\\mathrm{Jac}(R)\\)</span> in Artinian rings.</li>\n<li>Writing the intersection by bounded separation inside <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> also gives <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Jac}(R)=R\">\\(\\mathrm{Jac}(R)=R\\)</span> when the family of maximal left ideals is empty; an unbounded intersection of the empty family would not denote a ZFC set.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-ring","status":"resolved","id":"1c30d21ea7b443f6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-ring]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ring","status":"resolved","id":"1c30d21ea7b443f6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$R,+,\\cdot,0_R,1_R,x,r,I,\\mathfrak m\\in V\\land\\operatorname{Ring}_S(R,+,\\cdot,0_R,1_R)$ (see [[58-df-ring]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"R,+,\\cdot,0_R,1_R,x,r,I,\\mathfrak m\\in V\\land\\operatorname{Ring}_S(R,+,\\cdot,0_R,1_R)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{LeftIdeal}_S,\\operatorname{MaximalLeftIdeal}_S\\subseteq V^6","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LeftInvertible}_S\\subseteq V^6","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Jac}:V^5\\to V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}jacobson\\text{-}radical\\text{-}left\\text{-}ideal} \\vdash \\operatorname{LeftIdeal}_S(I;R,+,\\cdot,0_R,1_R)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Ring}_S(R,+,\\cdot,0_R,1_R)\\land I\\subseteq R\\land0_R\\in I\\land\\forall a,b\\in I\\;(a-b\\in I)\\land\\forall r\\in R\\;\\forall a\\in I\\;(r\\cdot a\\in I)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}jacobson\\text{-}radical\\text{-}maximal} \\vdash \\operatorname{MaximalLeftIdeal}_S(\\mathfrak m;R,+,\\cdot,0_R,1_R)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{LeftIdeal}_S(\\mathfrak m;R,+,\\cdot,0_R,1_R)\\land\\mathfrak m\\neq R\\land\\forall I\\;((\\operatorname{LeftIdeal}_S(I;R,+,\\cdot,0_R,1_R)\\land\\mathfrak m\\subseteq I\\subsetneq R)\\to I=\\mathfrak m)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}jacobson\\text{-}radical\\text{-}intersection} \\vdash \\mathrm{Jac}(R,+,\\cdot,0_R,1_R)\\coloneqq\\{x\\in R:\\forall\\mathfrak m\\subseteq R\\;(\\operatorname{MaximalLeftIdeal}_S(\\mathfrak m;R,+,\\cdot,0_R,1_R)\\to x\\in\\mathfrak m)\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}jacobson\\text{-}radical\\text{-}left\\text{-}inverse} \\vdash \\mathrm{LeftInvertible}_S(a;R,+,\\cdot,0_R,1_R)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Ring}_S(R,+,\\cdot,0_R,1_R)\\land a\\in R\\land\\exists u\\in R\\;(u\\cdot a=1_R)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}jacobson\\text{-}radical\\text{-}criterion} \\vdash x\\in\\mathrm{Jac}(R,+,\\cdot,0_R,1_R)\\leftrightarrow x\\in R\\land\\forall r\\in R\\;\\mathrm{LeftInvertible}_S(1_R-r\\cdot x;R,+,\\cdot,0_R,1_R)","display":true},{"tex":"x\\in\\mathrm{Jac}(R)","display":false},{"tex":"1_R-rx","display":false},{"tex":"r\\in R","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Jac}(R)","display":false},{"tex":"R","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Jac}(R)=R","display":false}],"bytes":2488,"backlinks":[{"id":"a0a1c48294b2e248","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Jac}:V^5\\to V$ (Jacobson-radical operator with the full ring structure; see [[../batch03/58-df-jacobson-radical.md]])"},{"id":"85a2ae5fb67dda7f","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{LeftIdeal}_S(I;R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R)$ 是结构参数完全显式的左理想谓词（see [[../batch03/58-df-jacobson-radical.md]]）"},{"id":"6411987be5be125a","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{LeftIdeal}_S$ and $\\mathrm{Jac}$ (see [[../batch03/58-df-jacobson-radical.md]])"},{"id":"a11585cba9c21cfd","anchor":"ref-266","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[58-df-jacobson-radical]]"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-716","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-jacobson-radical.md|58-df-jacobson-radical]]（batch03）"}],"outgoing":["1c30d21ea7b443f6"]}